  "bio": "Frede Tizzot is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Curitiba, Brazil, specializing in geometric and fineline styles. Known for their meticulous attention to detail, Frede transforms skin into a canvas of intricate blackwork and Maori designs. Clients are consistently impressed with the cleanliness of their workspace, both at Leviathan Tattoo Studio and Hindu Tattoo Studio. Frede's commitment to a sterile environment ensures that every tattoo is not only a work of art but also completed with the highest standards of safety.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Curitiba, Parana, Brazil\n\nBem-vindos a esse novo perfil\n〰️ Blackwork, Fine line e Maori\n✖️Orçamentos por DM✖️\nCuritiba @leviathantattoostudio\nPenha-SC @hindutattoostudiooficial",
